import DerivedAlgGeo.AlgebraicGeometry.Group.GeneralLinear

/-!
# Group schemes

Extensions of Mathlib's group schemes (group objects of `Over S`), in the namespace
`AlgebraicGeometry`.

## Main definitions

None: this umbrella re-exports its children, among them `Scheme.generalLinearGroup`, the general
linear group scheme.

## Main results

None; this module re-exports its children, among them the smoothness and affineness of the
structure morphism of `Scheme.generalLinearGroup`.

## Implementation notes

The children extend `Mathlib/AlgebraicGeometry/Group/` and need Mathlib alone. Nothing here
imports moduli, stacks or stability.

## Tags

group scheme, general linear group
-/
